  <data name="Pagination.Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>A page-number navigator for splitting a list of items across multiple pages.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.FewPages" xml:space="preserve"><value>Few pages</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.FewPages.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>When every page fits, all of them are shown with no collapsed gaps.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.ManyPages" xml:space="preserve"><value>Many pages</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.ManyPages.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>With more pages than fit, the boundary and sibling pages are shown and the rest collapse into an ellipsis.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.SinglePage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Single page</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.SinglePage.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>When everything fits on one page, the component renders nothing.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.OutOfRange" xml:space="preserve"><value>Page beyond the range</value></data>  <data name="Pagination.OutOfRange.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>A page past the end — after a filter narrows the list, or from a hand-edited URL — settles on the nearest page.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.CurrentPage.Label" xml:space="preserve"><value>Current page</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.PageInput" xml:space="preserve"><value>Jump to a page</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.PageInput.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>An optional box for typing a page number — useful when there are far too many pages to click through. Press Enter or the button to go.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.InputOnly" xml:space="preserve"><value>Input only</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.InputOnly.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>The typing box on its own, with no page links — the most compact pager, for tight toolbars.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.BareInput" xml:space="preserve"><value>Input only, no button</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.BareInput.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Just the box. Press Enter to go.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.Section.InsideForm" xml:space="preserve"><value>Inside a form</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.InsideForm.Note" xml:space="preserve"><value>Enter jumps to the page without submitting the surrounding form. The submission count stays at zero.</value></data>
  <data name="Pagination.InsideForm.Submits" xml:space="preserve"><value>Form submissions</value></data>
